+    /**
+     * Derives an owner's segment, as required by the API's read-only {@code ownerSegment} field:
+     * {@code '<TIER>_<AREA>'}, one of {@code 'PREMIUM_METRO'}, {@code 'PREMIUM_REGIONAL'},
